[1384.437542, "i", "cat > /app/output/answer.txt << 'EOF'\n## Statute\n\n§1(a)(iv) (line 16): \"$35,928.50, plus 36% of the excess over $140,000 if the taxable income is over $140,000 but not over $250,000\"\n\n§151(d)(1) (line 72): \"the term 'exemption amount' means $2,000\"\n\n§63(c)(2)(A) (lines 389-391): \"the basic standard deduction is- (A) 200 percent of the dollar amount in effect under subparagraph (C) for the taxable year in the case of- (i) a joint return\"\n\n§63(c)(2)(C) (line 396): \"$3,000 in any other case\"\n\n§63(f)(2)(A) (lines 454-455): \"The taxpayer shall be entitled to an additional amount of $600- (A) for himself if he is blind at the close of the taxable year\"\n\n§152(1)(B) (line 154): \"The term 'qualifying relative' means... (B) who has no income for the calendar year in which such taxable year begins\"\n\n## Reasoning\n\n1. **Marital Status**: Alice and Bob file jointly (married since Feb 3, 2017, determined under §7703)\n\n2. **Gross Income**: Alice ($133,200) + Bob ($44,311) = $177,511\n\n3. **Standard Deduction** (§63(c)"]
[1384.437688, "i", "(2)(A) and §63(c)(2)(C) lines 389-396):\n   - Basic standard deduction for joint return = 200% × $3,000 = $6,000\n   - Additional standard deduction for blind (§63(f)(2)(A) lines 454-455): Alice is blind since Feb 28, 2014, so she is blind at the close of the taxable year = $600\n   - Total standard deduction = $6,000 + $600 = $6,600\n\n4. **Personal Exemptions** (§151(d)(1) line 72):\n   - Exemption amount = $2,000 per person\n   - Charlie is NOT a dependent because Charlie has income ($4,525 from work) - §152(1)(B) line 154 requires qualifying relative to have \"no income\"\n   - Exemptions: Alice ($2,000) + Bob ($2,000) = $4,000\n\n5. **Taxable Income** (§63(b) line 366):\n   - Taxable income = Gross income - Standard deduction - Personal exemptions\n   - Taxable income = $177,511 - $6,600 - $4,000 = $166,911\n\n6. **Tax Calculation** (§1(a)(iv) line 16):\n   - Taxable income $166,911 is over $140,000 but not over $250,000\n   - Tax = $35,928.50 + 36% × ($166,911 - $140,000)\n   - Tax = $35,928.50 + 0.36 × $26,911\n "]
[1384.437796, "o", "cat > /app/output/answer.txt << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Statute\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
